Pantheon</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="R32"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Siebenaler</surname><given-names>JB</given-names></name><name><surname>Caldwell</surname><given-names>DK</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Cooperation among adult dolphins</article-title><source>J Mamm</source><year>1956</year><volume>37</volume><fpage>126</fpage><lpage>128</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="R33"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hallet</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name><name><surname>Pelle</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><source>Animal Kitabu</source><year>1968</year><publisher-loc>New York</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Random House</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="R34"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Berkson</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Social responses to abnormal infant monkeys</article-title><source>Am J Phys Anthrop</source><year>1974</year><volume>38</volume><fpage>583</fpage><lpage>586</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">4632108</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R35"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Keele</surname><given-names>CA</given-names></name><name><surname>Neil</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Jepson</surname><given-names>JB</given-names></name></person-group><source>Samson Wright&#x02019;s applied physiology</source><year>1961</year><edition>10th ed.</edition><publisher-loc>London</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Oxford University Press</publisher-name><fpage>viii</fpage></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>